{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_038chz01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_038chz01_title", "source_sha256": "3d6b744c71442a1f1aa0487b0f2ff74ed2a1127d6ded5b9796d804fc4281f144", "ja": "千鶴とおでかけ1", "zh": "和千鹤出门1", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_038chz01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_038chz01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "37cac544ada9e4301379d17c6695ca4c1808438d24a34faeabe93ae2e0847f2e", "ja": "千鶴とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "与千鹤一同外出的情景。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_038chz01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_038chz01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f9ceeae27cbe5b9a81697a880c3f39b8bb6251d7a2f2da0d915abe321b961084", "ja": "（千鶴さんが、仙台のとある観光施設の、ポスター\nモデルとして選ばれた。なかなかの大役だ！）", "zh": "（千鹤小姐被选为仙台某个旅游设施的海报模特了。真是个相当重要的工作啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_038chz01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_038chz01_1001_038chz", "source_sha256": "c7bc1f404ac59785bdec62f417e7a2200b7538e8274932b6d5a6b464862174d7", "ja": "うーん、仙台っぽさ……つまり、宮城っぽさが\n必要ですわ。どのようなポーズが良いかしら……。", "zh": "嗯……需要体现出仙台的感觉……也就是宫城的感觉才行。摆什么姿势比较好呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_038chz01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_038chz01_1002_038chz", "source_sha256": "601d1157995712793ff92c7ce9e249fb3bf47df7358ec22ba7625716ed5a1705", "ja": "駅などにも掲載されるらしいですし、\nたくさんの方の興味を惹くポーズにしなくては！", "zh": "听说还会刊登在车站之类的地方，所以一定要摆出能吸引许多人兴趣的姿势才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_038chz01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_038chz01_1003_038chz", "source_sha256": "e97eff4ed2f30c2fd1dc0fc463058b4aff96d08053647300769141c534927e27", "ja": "例えば、こう、手で宮城県の形を表現したり……\nあらっ、難しいですわね！？", "zh": "比如说，像这样，用手摆出宫城县的形状之类的……\n哎呀，真难呢！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_038chz01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_038chz01_1004_p", "source_sha256": "a4429ec6d0ba1b5cfce6903a08964b27b90b29cd95df7be6a353423e4e3275ad", "ja": "いえ。宮城っぽさにこだわるよりも、ここはひとつ、\n千鶴さんの飛び切りの笑顔で行きましょう！", "zh": "不用。与其拘泥于宫城特色，这里倒不如\n就用千鹤小姐最棒的笑容来一决胜负吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_038chz01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_038chz01_1005_038chz", "source_sha256": "864ee344eb44565fd49f85dc3d9d088f17324f8d36fb38b4b4d23e908d90f50e", "ja": "もちろん、笑顔でと言われれば応えますが……\nけど、それだけでいいんですの？", "zh": "若是要求我展露笑容，我自然会照办……\n可是，仅仅如此就可以了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_038chz01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_038chz01_1006_p", "source_sha256": "c39fe19d90e3392de90f5037d1336aba59544f389fa124262b058cc0366314d6", "ja": "はい。千鶴さんの笑顔は華やかで、人目を惹きます。\nきっと最高の一枚になりますよ！", "zh": "是的。千鹤小姐的笑容明艳动人，很吸引眼球。\n一定能拍出最棒的一张照片！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_038chz01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_038chz01_1007_038chz", "source_sha256": "9dfed720c69e33ce129a0c6ee8cc2a044967c0312175ad2b639c42a7d61393a0", "ja": "あら、そんな……♪　ふふ、わかりましたわ！\nでは最高の笑顔を、みなさまにご覧いただきましょう！", "zh": "哎呀，哪有这回事……♪　呵呵，我明白了！\n那就让大家见识一下，我最棒的笑容吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_038chz01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_038chz01_1008_p", "source_sha256": "fe2ebeb39f4a53be830b9cba4e7839335325b438c8331b345d545cd3af5986e0", "ja": "（千鶴さんの笑顔は、大好評だった。観光地を背景に、\n特産品なども合成されるらしい……楽しみだな！）", "zh": "（千鹤的笑容大受好评。听说还会以旅游景点为背景，合成特产之类的……好期待啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
